{
  "title": "Light Umami Portuguese Cucumber Salad",
  "description": "A refreshing and light salad featuring persian cucumber, perfect for a post-workout snack, with a hint of umami flavor from the portuguese ingredients",
  "cuisine": "Portuguese",
  "diet": [
